{
  "version": "2.21",
  "children": [
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "ZsN5hj",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "README",
      "width": 720,
      "fill": "$bg",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": "$space-16",
      "padding": "$space-48",
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "6ebEFS",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "Thoth Dashboard v2 · README",
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "44Q4GC",
          "name": "Summary",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Redesign of Thoth, a dark web dashboard that turns a social media post (TikTok, X, Instagram, YouTube) into a content set and then a short video. design/thoth-dashboard.pen is the read-only reference: never open, edit, copy over, or delete anything in it.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "MMMPMY",
          "name": "Layout heading",
          "fill": "$faint",
          "content": "LAYOUT",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "t4RTyt",
          "name": "Layout",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "• Desktop reference width 1440, narrow width 430\n• Top bar 64 high\n• Left sidebar 232 wide, collapsible to 64\n• Content gutter 24",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "FCmx64",
          "name": "Rules heading",
          "fill": "$faint",
          "content": "GROUND RULES",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "3whcbs",
          "name": "Rules",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "1. Use only the defined variables, never raw hex values in nodes (a light theme comes later and must be a variable swap, not a redraw).\n2. Font: Geist for UI, Geist Mono for timestamps, IDs, durations and logs.\n3. Icons: lucide-style icon nodes, 16 px in rows, 20 px in the sidebar.\n4. No drop shadows except dialogs/popovers; separate surfaces by tone, not borders.\n5. No placeholder numbers or lorem ipsum: use the realistic sample content provided.\n6. Build reusable components first, screens from instances.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 14,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
