    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "T1TEF",
      "x": 12720,
      "y": 15300,
      "name": "Studio shell v2 · README",
      "width": 760,
      "fill": "$bg",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 14,
      "padding": 40,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "x7V53",
          "name": "Title",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "content": "Studio shell v2 · Responsive shell",
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 24,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "LnpXh",
          "name": "Summary",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "One shell for Story and Timeline at 1440, 1024 and 430 px. Only the header, pane switching, asset naming, inspector density, beat strip and issues bar change; render, Review and the preview controls are untouched.",
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ung8k",
          "name": "Heading · HEADER · 56 PX, ONE ROW",
          "fill": "$faint",
          "content": "HEADER · 56 PX, ONE ROW",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.8
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "h4Bplf",
          "name": "Body · HEADER · 56 PX, ONE ROW",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Tier 1 (always): back, draft title, jobs Edit / Review / Render, mode Story / Timeline, undo / redo, save status, Request review, overflow. Tier 2 (1440 Story only): narration status chip. Tier 3 (overflow): narration status with Re-voice / Recreate, Script, Assist, Settings. At 1024 the back label drops to an icon and the chip folds into the overflow menu, marked by an amber dot on the button when a beat needs re-voice. Nothing wraps or stacks; the Indonesian 1024 frame is the width test.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "oAt0M",
          "name": "Heading · 430 PX",
          "fill": "$faint",
          "content": "430 PX",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.8
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "syw2d",
          "name": "Body · 430 PX",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "No horizontal page scroll. Header: back, title with a status line, one overflow button that opens a sheet holding mode, jobs, save, history, narration, Script, Assist, Settings and Request review. Panes switch with a tab row: Materials / Preview / Inspector in Story, Assets / Preview / Timeline / Inspector in Timeline. Beats are a one-row chip scroller with edge fades; the total stays pinned on the left. Timeline is a view-only lane stack with a larger-screen note and an Inspect shortcut.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "nSkli",
          "name": "Heading · NAMING",
          "fill": "$faint",
          "content": "NAMING",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.8
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "lO8Rd",
          "name": "Body · NAMING",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Every asset and clip uses a human label (kind · source), its kind and its length in seconds. IDs never appear. Same-name clips differ by label prefix and kind icon, for example Comment card vs Profile card · @lailynisfa. Labels wrap instead of truncating.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "h9F5u",
          "name": "Heading · DENSITY AND TRUTH",
          "fill": "$faint",
          "content": "DENSITY AND TRUTH",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.8
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "KqCdN",
          "name": "Body · DENSITY AND TRUTH",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Scene heading is a two-line clamp with Edit. Beat tiles show each beat's own seconds; the total (46.0 s) equals the canvas length: 5.8 + 14.2 + 8.0 + 9.0 + 6.4 + 2.6. Green mic = narrated. Amber mic = text changed after recording (needs re-voice); only the selected beat has an outline.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "JQZeL",
          "name": "Heading · TOOLTIPS",
          "fill": "$faint",
          "content": "TOOLTIPS",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.8
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Hit54",
          "name": "Body · TOOLTIPS",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Any clamped or icon-only text carries a tooltip: draft title (1024 ID frame), scene heading (1440), Add beat (1024), needs re-voice mic (1440), timeline clip names (1440). Clip labels are only drawn where they fit.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "nRoY6",
          "name": "Heading · ISSUES",
          "fill": "$faint",
          "content": "ISSUES",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.8
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "oTOl4",
          "name": "Body · ISSUES",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The bottom line keeps its text. Review issues opens a list grouped by lane (popover at 1024, bottom sheet at 430). Clicking an issue selects its clip and moves the playhead.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DBmgM",
          "name": "Heading · ASSUMPTIONS TO CHECK",
          "fill": "$faint",
          "content": "ASSUMPTIONS TO CHECK",
          "fontFamily": "$font-mono",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": 0.8
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "j82bm",
          "name": "Body · ASSUMPTIONS TO CHECK",
          "fill": "$ink",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "UI text uses the file's $font-ui token (Geist), the font the dashboard ships. Indonesian copy is a draft for width testing. Icon buttons are 28 px visual with a 44 px hit area on phone rows. Timeline keeps the product's edit tools (trim, split, ripple delete), Ripple, Snap and the zoom slider, and the product's clip inspector fields (Start/End, Transform, Clip); Assist opens its panel rather than toggling.",
          "lineHeight": 1.45,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "variables": {
    "bg": {
      "type": "color",
      "value": "#18191B"
    },
    "well": {
      "type": "color",
      "value": "#101113"
